{"seq":4,"slug":"https-and-tls","title":"HTTPS 与 TLS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/security-architecture/https-and-tls","wordCount":548,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"https-与-tls\">HTTPS 与 TLS</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>HTTPS（HTTP over TLS）是 Web 安全的基石，通过 TLS（Transport Layer Security）协议为 HTTP 通信提供加密、完整性验证和身份认证三重保护。在现代 Web 开发中，HTTPS 已不再是可选项——浏览器限制 HTTP 页面使用 Service Worker、地理位置、摄像头等敏感 API，搜索引擎对 HTTP 站点降权，Cookie 的 Secure 属性要求 HTTPS 传输。</p>\n<p>TLS 1.3 是当前最新的标准，相比 TLS 1.2 减少了握手延迟（从 2-RTT 到 1-RTT，甚至 0-RTT），移除了不安全的加密套件，显著提升了安全性和性能。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[客户端] --&gt;|1. ClientHello| B[服务端]&#10;    B --&gt;|2. ServerHello + 证书| A&#10;    A --&gt;|3. 密钥交换 + Finished| B&#10;    B --&gt;|4. Finished| A&#10;    A &lt;--&gt;|加密通信| B\">graph LR\n    A[客户端] --&gt;|1. ClientHello| B[服务端]\n    B --&gt;|2. ServerHello + 证书| A\n    A --&gt;|3. 密钥交换 + Finished| B\n    B --&gt;|4. Finished| A\n    A &lt;--&gt;|加密通信| B</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>TLS 版本</th>\n<th>握手延迟</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>支持状态</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TLS 1.0</td>\n<td>2-RTT</td>\n<td>低（已知漏洞）</td>\n<td>已废弃</td>\n<td>禁用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TLS 1.1</td>\n<td>2-RTT</td>\n<td>低（已知漏洞）</td>\n<td>已废弃</td>\n<td>禁用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TLS 1.2</td>\n<td>2-RTT</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>广泛支持</td>\n<td>可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TLS 1.3</td>\n<td>1-RTT / 0-RTT</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>主流支持</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"证书管理与自动化\">证书管理与自动化</h2><p>TLS 证书是 HTTPS 的核心，Let&#39;s Encrypt 提供了免费的自动化证书管理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 certbot 获取证书&#10;certbot certonly --webroot -w /var/www/html -d example.com -d www.example.com&#10;&#10;# 自动续签（通过 cron 或 systemd timer）&#10;certbot renew --quiet --post-hook &quot;systemctl reload nginx&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 certbot 获取证书</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">certbot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> certonly</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --webroot</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/www/html</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> example.com</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> www.example.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 自动续签（通过 cron 或 systemd timer）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">certbot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> renew</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --quiet</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --post-hook</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"systemctl reload nginx\"</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nginx\" data-code=\"# Nginx HTTPS 配置&#10;server {&#10;    listen 443 ssl http2;&#10;    server_name example.com;&#10;&#10;    ssl_certificate /etc/letsencrypt/live/example.com/fullchain.pem;&#10;    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/example.com/privkey.pem;&#10;&#10;    ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;&#10;    ssl_ciphers ECDHE-ECDSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-ECDSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384:ECDHE-RSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384;&#10;    ssl_prefer_server_ciphers off;&#10;&#10;    ssl_session_cache shared:SSL:10m;&#10;    ssl_session_timeout 1d;&#10;    ssl_session_tickets off;&#10;&#10;    ssl_stapling on;&#10;    ssl_stapling_verify on;&#10;    resolver 8.8.8.8 8.8.4.4 valid=300s;&#10;&#10;    add_header Strict-Transport-Security &quot;max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload&quot; always;&#10;}&#10;&#10;server {&#10;    listen 80;&#10;    server_name example.com www.example.com;&#10;    return 301 https://$host$request_uri;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Nginx HTTPS 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>server {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    listen 443 ssl http2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    server_name example.com;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ssl_certificate /etc/letsencrypt/live/example.com/fullchain.pem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/example.com/privkey.pem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ssl_ciphers ECDHE-ECDSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-ECDSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384:ECDHE-RSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ssl_prefer_server_ciphers off;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ssl_session_cache shared:SSL:10m;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ssl_session_timeout 1d;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ssl_session_tickets off;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ssl_stapling on;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ssl_stapling_verify on;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resolver 8.8.8.8 8.8.4.4 valid=300s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    add_header Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload\" always;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>server {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    listen 80;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    server_name example.com www.example.com;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return 301 https://$host$request_uri;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Node.js 中的 HTTPS 配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import https from &#39;node:https&#39;;&#10;import fs from &#39;node:fs&#39;;&#10;&#10;const httpsOptions = {&#10;  key: fs.readFileSync(&#39;/etc/letsencrypt/live/example.com/privkey.pem&#39;),&#10;  cert: fs.readFileSync(&#39;/etc/letsencrypt/live/example.com/fullchain.pem&#39;),&#10;  minVersion: &#39;TLSv1.2&#39; as const,&#10;  ciphers: [&#10;    &#39;ECDHE-ECDSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256&#39;,&#10;    &#39;ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256&#39;,&#10;    &#39;ECDHE-ECDSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384&#39;,&#10;    &#39;ECDHE-RSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384&#39;,&#10;  ].join(&#39;:&#39;),&#10;};&#10;&#10;const server = https.createServer(httpsOptions, app);&#10;server.listen(443);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> https </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:https'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:fs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> httpsOptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  key: fs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">readFileSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/etc/letsencrypt/live/example.com/privkey.pem'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cert: fs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">readFileSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/etc/letsencrypt/live/example.com/fullchain.pem'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  minVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TLSv1.2'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ciphers: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'ECDHE-ECDSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'ECDHE-ECDSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'ECDHE-RSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">':'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> https.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createServer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(httpsOptions, app);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">server.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">listen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">443</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"混合内容与协议降级\">混合内容与协议降级</h2><p>混合内容（Mixed Content）是 HTTPS 页面中加载 HTTP 资源的问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 检测混合内容&#10;const detectMixedContent = () =&gt; {&#10;  if (window.location.protocol !== &#39;https:&#39;) return;&#10;&#10;  const observer = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; {&#10;    for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {&#10;      if (&#39;name&#39; in entry &amp;&amp; typeof entry.name === &#39;string&#39;) {&#10;        if (entry.name.startsWith(&#39;http://&#39;)) {&#10;          console.warn(&#39;混合内容:&#39;, entry.name);&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  observer.observe({ entryTypes: [&#39;resource&#39;] });&#10;};&#10;&#10;// CSP 自动升级不安全请求&#10;// Content-Security-Policy: upgrade-insecure-requests\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 检测混合内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> detectMixedContent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (window.location.protocol </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'https:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> observer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--s